Input drivers: physical controller activity polling and gamepad type detection. SDLInputDriver and XinputInputDriver record the host uptime timestamp and controller type (SDL_GamepadType) on physical button presses or stick/trigger deflection past deadzone. InputSystem::GetLastPhysicalControllerActivity exposes the latest physical activity across drivers so game-side glyph replacement can detect active gamepads without linking SDL.

